@startuml Manager Audit Trail Sequence
title Sequence Diagram: Truy xuất lịch sử hoạt động (Manager)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-audit.html" as UI
control "AuditLogController" as Ctrl
entity "AuditLogService" as Svc
database "MySQL" as DB

Manager -> UI: Tìm kiếm theo User, Hành động, Thời gian
UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/audit-logs?user=...&action=...
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: getFilteredLogs(params)
activate Svc

Svc -> DB: findAll(predicate)
activate DB
DB --> Svc: List<AuditLog>
deactivate DB

Svc --> Ctrl: List<AuditLogResponse>
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Ctrl

UI -> Manager: Hiển thị danh sách lịch sử thao tác
@enduml
